      "content": "yeah the gunk makes sense but it's just so annoying how it feels like something is \"stuck\" in there even when i can't see it. like i'm basically poking around in the dark. is there any way to tell if it's just a buildup or if something is actually wedged in there deep down? maybe there's a way to see inside without taking everything apart?",
